  "label": "User projected onto the scene of taking a photo with family",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene 'taking_a_photo_with_family' as the implied subject of the activity. The text 'taking a photo with family' and the visual of a group posing together create an inclusive, participatory frame where the viewer is invited to imagine themselves as part of the family gathering or as the one taking the photo. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the scene and text collectively invite the user to identify with the familial, celebratory moment being depicted.",
